WEBVTT

00:08.700 --> 00:15.340
<b>Picking up the yesterday that
someone threw away</b>

00:15.340 --> 00:18.680
<b>I just reached my hand out
like a daredevil</b>

00:18.680 --> 00:21.980
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:21.980 --> 00:27.420
<b>No matter what I get, I won't
ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.620 --> 00:34.560
<b>Escape from the gaps in
your tangled up heart</b>

00:34.560 --> 00:36.630
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.630 --> 00:41.840
<b>I hear your voice in the rusted time</b>

00:41.840 --> 00:44.910
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.910 --> 00:48.140
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.140 --> 00:51.780
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.780 --> 00:55.410
<b>Right away</b>

01:05.960 --> 01:08.000
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.000 --> 01:13.270
<b>I search for myself in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.270 --> 01:16.370
<b>I want to seize it with my own hands</b>

01:16.370 --> 01:19.610
<b>You are waiting, no matter where I am</b>

01:19.610 --> 01:23.180
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.180 --> 01:25.810
<b>Right away</b>

02:51.130 --> 02:52.600
<b>Let's go.</b>

02:54.340 --> 02:56.570
<b>What is it? What in the
world's happening?</b>

02:56.570 --> 02:58.040
<b>Lady Gyokumen Koushu!</b>

02:59.040 --> 03:01.980
<b>What in the world is this
commotion about?</b>

03:01.980 --> 03:03.480
<b>Please flee at once!</b>

03:03.480 --> 03:04.880
<b>We're under attack!</b>

03:04.880 --> 03:06.640
<b>What did you say?!</b>

03:08.320 --> 03:12.880
<b>Freeze! You're completely
surrounded. Resistance is futile.</b>

03:15.090 --> 03:18.030
<b>Who the hell are you people?
Where did you come from?!</b>

03:18.890 --> 03:20.360
<b>Who are we?</b>

03:23.930 --> 03:25.400
<b>Can't you tell just by looking?</b>

03:27.170 --> 03:28.900
<b>We're gods!</b>

03:28.900 --> 03:30.370
<b>What?!</b>

03:43.020 --> 03:44.790
<b>I was careless.</b>

03:44.790 --> 03:47.550
<b>I never expected anyone to launch a
nocturnal assault on Houtou Castle.</b>

03:49.290 --> 03:54.260
<b>Lord Kougaiji, I'm gathering a
counterattack force in Block Three!</b>

03:54.260 --> 03:57.130
<b>Good! Chase the intruders
into that area.</b>

03:57.130 --> 03:58.600
<b>Yes, my Lord.</b>

03:59.130 --> 04:02.040
<b>Kou, the security squad has been
virtually wiped out!</b>

04:02.040 --> 04:03.040
<b>What?!</b>

04:03.040 --> 04:05.210
<b>I just got the report.</b>

04:05.210 --> 04:07.640
<b>Impossible! In such a short time?!</b>

04:07.640 --> 04:09.140
<b>Yeah...</b>

04:09.140 --> 04:11.840
<b>Who the hell are these guys?!</b>

04:12.950 --> 04:15.220
<b>According to the report
from the survivors,</b>

04:15.220 --> 04:17.590
<b>the enemy apparently
claimed to be gods.</b>

04:17.590 --> 04:20.950
<b>And their foreheads were definitely
marked with chakras.</b>

04:21.690 --> 04:26.730
<b>Chakras? It's proof that the bearer
is a god or close to the gods.</b>

04:26.730 --> 04:29.720
<b>Could it be that gods have really
come to invade us?!</b>

04:31.400 --> 04:35.300
<b>Any opponent will be dead meat
once we get our hands on them!</b>

04:35.300 --> 04:36.040
<b>Yaone!</b>

04:36.040 --> 04:37.070
<b>Yes, my Lord?
Yaone!</b>

04:37.070 --> 04:37.540
<b>Yes, my Lord?
Take care of Lirin.</b>

04:37.540 --> 04:38.540
<b>Take care of Lirin.</b>

04:38.540 --> 04:39.840
<b>I understand.</b>

04:39.840 --> 04:41.680
<b>Why?!</b>

04:41.680 --> 04:43.270
<b>Do as I say, Lirin!</b>

04:51.720 --> 04:53.190
<b>Let's go, Dokugakuji.</b>

04:57.030 --> 04:59.150
<b>Brother!</b>

05:02.500 --> 05:04.700
<b>Homura, it seems the experiments
to revive Gyumaoh</b>

05:04.700 --> 05:06.470
<b>are being carried out in the basement.</b>

05:06.470 --> 05:08.500
<b>Then the Scripture
should be there too.</b>

05:08.500 --> 05:10.100
<b>Yeah, no doubt about it.</b>

05:10.870 --> 05:12.340
<b>What shall we do?</b>

05:15.180 --> 05:17.670
<b>I'll go to the basement,
while you guys...</b>

05:19.750 --> 05:23.240
<b>I get it. We just have to deal
with the small fry, right?</b>

05:24.350 --> 05:25.820
<b>That's the idea.</b>

05:27.190 --> 05:28.690
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

05:28.690 --> 05:30.160
<b>You got it.</b>

05:30.790 --> 05:32.260
<b>Homura?</b>

05:33.130 --> 05:34.960
<b>Please be careful.</b>

05:41.670 --> 05:43.470
<b>How noisy.</b>

05:43.470 --> 05:44.770
<b>Isn't it?</b>

05:44.770 --> 05:46.410
<b>Dr. Ni!</b>

05:46.410 --> 05:48.080
<b>We're under attack!</b>

05:48.080 --> 05:49.980
<b>It'll be dangerous if we don't
evacuate right away!</b>

05:50.750 --> 05:53.520
<b>Why are you in such a fluster?</b>

05:53.520 --> 05:58.680
<b>Why are YOU so calm?! The enemy's
almost here already!</b>

06:00.120 --> 06:03.390
<b>The enemy? Are they
really our enemy?</b>

06:03.960 --> 06:05.760
<b>What did you say?!</b>

06:05.760 --> 06:11.030
<b>Of course, in my case, everyone
except me is the enemy.</b>

06:11.030 --> 06:13.900
<b>Sanzo and his companions,
His Highness,</b>

06:13.900 --> 06:16.910
<b>and you too, Dr. Huang.</b>

06:16.910 --> 06:18.630
<b>Why am I your enemy?!</b>

06:19.270 --> 06:22.140
<b>My rival in love for Lady
Gyokumen Koushu.</b>

06:22.740 --> 06:23.810
<b>Am I wrong?</b>

06:23.810 --> 06:25.550
<b>You ARE wrong!</b>

06:25.550 --> 06:28.650
<b>Besides, why are you bringing that up
at a time like this?!</b>

06:28.650 --> 06:30.250
<b>It's because it's a time like this</b>

06:30.250 --> 06:33.350
<b>that we should calm down and get
a clear view of the situation.</b>

06:35.390 --> 06:37.450
<b>Now, then, I guess I'll go.</b>

06:40.430 --> 06:42.260
<b>Where are you going?</b>

06:42.260 --> 06:44.630
<b>I'm going to do work equal to
what my paycheck is worth.</b>

06:49.040 --> 06:52.470
<b>Dr. Ni, the evacuation block
isn't that way!</b>

06:52.470 --> 06:56.100
<b>I know. I know that.</b>

06:59.110 --> 07:00.380
<b>Damn!</b>

07:00.380 --> 07:03.590
<b>Kougaiji, they've split into two groups!</b>

07:03.590 --> 07:07.060
<b>It seems one group took the
elevator to the basement!</b>

07:07.060 --> 07:08.560
<b>It's as I thought.</b>

07:08.560 --> 07:09.620
<b>As you thought?</b>

07:09.620 --> 07:13.600
<b>If they're really gods, they can
only be after one thing!</b>

07:13.600 --> 07:15.360
<b>My father!</b>

07:15.360 --> 07:16.870
<b>I see.</b>

07:16.870 --> 07:19.870
<b>Let's go, Dokugakuji! The stairs!</b>

07:19.870 --> 07:21.370
<b>Right!</b>

07:21.370 --> 07:23.200
<b>The lowest level.</b>

07:23.200 --> 07:26.000
<b>The door to Hell is about
to be opened.</b>

07:27.540 --> 07:32.500
<b>Son Goku, I doubt even you
have been to Hell.</b>

07:33.680 --> 07:37.740
<b>Watch closely what I do from now on.</b>

07:39.650 --> 07:43.720
<b>I'm doing this partly for you as well.</b>

07:55.440 --> 07:58.140
<b>Kou, the she-fox isn't here.</b>

07:58.140 --> 08:00.580
<b>She's escaped on her own, leaving
everyone else behind.</b>

08:00.580 --> 08:03.680
<b>Yeah, I expected that.</b>

08:03.680 --> 08:06.550
<b>But to think she abandoned
my father and ran,</b>

08:06.550 --> 08:08.880
<b>only taking the Seiten
Scripture with her.</b>

08:10.190 --> 08:12.320
<b>Are you just going to leave things
as they are?</b>

08:12.320 --> 08:13.820
<b>We have no choice.</b>

08:13.820 --> 08:16.760
<b>Right now, our priority is to drive away
the attacking intruders.</b>

08:17.990 --> 08:19.890
<b>They're sure to come here.</b>

08:22.230 --> 08:23.890
<b>Lady Gyokumen Koushu, this way!</b>

08:24.570 --> 08:26.030
<b>Yes!</b>

08:27.940 --> 08:30.670
<b>I can't believe this is happening!</b>

08:30.670 --> 08:34.160
<b>An attack from the Heavens is
totally out of left field.</b>

08:35.580 --> 08:37.440
<b>I never thought something
like this would happen.</b>

08:48.560 --> 08:54.190
<b>500 years ago, Nataku subjugated
Gyumaoh here, in this very castle.</b>

08:54.900 --> 08:59.200
<b>Houtou Castle was not so
defenseless back then.</b>

09:00.500 --> 09:05.970
<b>They're using all the energy in this
castle to resurrect Gyumaoh.</b>

09:05.970 --> 09:09.240
<b>And that's turned out to be
a huge risk for them.</b>

09:09.240 --> 09:13.920
<b>It's impossible to defeat us
with human wave tactics.</b>

09:13.920 --> 09:15.550
<b>Fools.</b>

09:15.550 --> 09:17.850
<b>They can't help it.</b>

09:17.850 --> 09:19.410
<b>They're under a surprise attack.</b>

09:25.860 --> 09:27.330
<b>You're...</b>

09:32.170 --> 09:33.840
<b>As expected.</b>

09:33.840 --> 09:35.500
<b>We've been waiting for you, god.</b>

09:37.110 --> 09:39.340
<b>So, it's Gyumaoh's son.</b>

09:39.340 --> 09:41.380
<b>My name's Kougaiji.</b>

09:41.380 --> 09:45.250
<b>I'm a swordsman in the service
of Kougaiji, Dokugakuji.</b>

09:45.250 --> 09:47.650
<b>War Prince Homura.</b>

09:47.650 --> 09:49.580
<b>War Prince?!</b>

09:49.580 --> 09:54.120
<b>The successor of War Prince Nataku,
who once subjugated Gyumaoh.</b>

09:54.120 --> 09:59.460
<b>So, your objective is
my father after all.</b>

09:59.460 --> 10:02.030
<b>The Heavens have sure
become impatient.</b>

10:02.030 --> 10:05.200
<b>Do you intend to eliminate him
even before he's resurrected?</b>

10:05.200 --> 10:09.570
<b>Whether Gyumaoh is revived or not
has nothing to do with me.</b>

10:09.570 --> 10:12.640
<b>I'm only interested in
the Seiten Scripture.</b>

10:12.640 --> 10:13.410
<b>What?!</b>

10:13.410 --> 10:17.340
<b>But it seems what I want isn't here.</b>

10:18.580 --> 10:20.670
<b>A secret passageway?</b>

10:25.190 --> 10:28.050
<b>I can't allow you to go any further.</b>

10:28.920 --> 10:30.410
<b>Move, you're in my way.</b>

10:34.830 --> 10:36.360
<b>You have a long way to go.</b>

10:36.360 --> 10:37.070
<b>What?!</b>

10:37.070 --> 10:39.490
<b>This is how you use a sword.</b>

10:45.540 --> 10:47.030
<b>Dokugakuji!</b>

10:49.380 --> 10:54.050
<b>Sorry, but I have no intention
of wasting my time here.</b>

10:54.050 --> 10:55.910
<b>I'll be going all-out from the start.</b>

11:12.530 --> 11:13.470
<b>Who are you?!</b>

11:13.470 --> 11:18.670
<b>Don't look so surprised, Konzen.
Oops, my bad, Genjo Sanzo.</b>

11:18.670 --> 11:20.780
<b>I asked who you were.</b>

11:20.780 --> 11:21.940
<b>I'm a god.</b>

11:21.940 --> 11:23.910
<b>Another god?</b>

11:23.910 --> 11:26.310
<b>We need to talk. Come outside.</b>

11:27.350 --> 11:28.940
<b>Like hell I'm going...</b>

11:31.820 --> 11:36.660
<b>It's futile to resist.
You already know that.</b>

11:36.660 --> 11:37.990
<b>A bodhisattva?</b>

11:37.990 --> 11:38.990
<b>Right.</b>

11:38.990 --> 11:41.060
<b>What the hell do you want?</b>

11:41.060 --> 11:45.120
<b>Don't be so cross. We shared a
passionate smooch once, remember?</b>

11:46.400 --> 11:49.570
<b>You can't kill a god with that thing.</b>

11:49.570 --> 11:54.280
<b>I'll have you know, I've had enough
of your stupid orders.</b>

11:54.280 --> 11:58.080
<b>Stopping the experiments to
revive Gyumaoh is stupid?</b>

11:58.080 --> 11:59.710
<b>You're the one who gave the order</b>

11:59.710 --> 12:04.090
<b>to take Goku, Gojyo, and Hakkai
with me, right?</b>

12:04.090 --> 12:06.950
<b>That's right. Aren't you having fun?</b>

12:06.950 --> 12:08.620
<b>They're a pain in the butt.</b>

12:08.620 --> 12:11.130
<b>I could more than finish
this task on my own.</b>

12:11.130 --> 12:12.830
<b>Well, that may be true.</b>

12:12.830 --> 12:14.930
<b>But you see, Genjo Sanzo,</b>

12:14.930 --> 12:19.330
<b>I've loved the four of you since
a long, long time ago.</b>

12:19.330 --> 12:20.940
<b>Enough to want to smooch you all.</b>

12:20.940 --> 12:22.560
<b>Die, you damn hag!</b>

12:25.910 --> 12:28.310
<b>I haven't heard that phrase
in a long time.</b>

12:34.250 --> 12:36.680
<b>Well, your speed's top-notch.</b>

12:42.720 --> 12:44.880
<b>Say your prayers, War Prince!</b>

12:53.630 --> 12:55.440
<b>Summoning a fiend?</b>

12:55.440 --> 12:56.960
<b>Looks like you'll be a fun opponent.</b>

12:58.010 --> 13:02.870
<b>Kai! Come forth, Engokuki!</b>

13:16.860 --> 13:18.330
<b>So, this is all?</b>

13:20.260 --> 13:21.920
<b>What?! He split the flames
with sword pressure?!</b>

13:22.630 --> 13:26.760
<b>You have a lot of skill, but it's
not enough to defeat me!</b>

13:41.220 --> 13:42.680
<b>Impossible...</b>

13:43.380 --> 13:45.050
<b>He erased the summoned fiend
in an instant!</b>

13:45.820 --> 13:48.920
<b>In the end, both what is holy and
what is evil comes down to power.</b>

13:48.920 --> 13:51.930
<b>Only those with power
rule the Lower World</b>

13:51.930 --> 13:54.190
<b>as well as rule the Heavens.</b>

13:54.860 --> 14:00.100
<b>Let us meet again, Kougaiji.
I rather like your type.</b>

14:00.670 --> 14:02.470
<b>Shut the hell up!</b>

14:08.740 --> 14:09.610
<b>Kou!</b>

14:09.610 --> 14:12.380
<b>Dokugaku, you okay?</b>

14:12.380 --> 14:13.850
<b>Yeah, just barely.</b>

14:14.650 --> 14:16.150
<b>He got away from us.</b>

14:16.150 --> 14:19.090
<b>Yeah, I've got a huge debt now.</b>

14:19.090 --> 14:21.420
<b>When it's time for payback, I'll give it
back to him a hundredfold.</b>

14:24.960 --> 14:27.400
<b>You bastard, so this is
where you were?</b>

14:27.400 --> 14:30.060
<b>Long time no see, Lord Zenon.</b>

14:30.060 --> 14:31.370
<b>Souei!</b>

14:31.370 --> 14:36.530
<b>Yes, I'm the demon Souei, who
once worked under you.</b>

14:40.370 --> 14:43.610
<b>Zenon, this is the Jade
Emperor's decree.</b>

14:43.610 --> 14:45.110
<b>It's unpardonable that you,
an immortal,</b>

14:45.110 --> 14:49.110
<b>became intimate with a human of the
Lower World and sired a child.</b>

14:50.050 --> 14:52.990
<b>Therefore, you'll be banished
to the Lower World.</b>

14:52.990 --> 14:57.660
<b>Yes, Sir. I was starting to get bored
with this place anyway.</b>

14:57.660 --> 15:00.680
<b>If my family and I can lead a lazy life
in the Lower World, then no...</b>

15:04.230 --> 15:05.700
<b>Mirei!</b>

15:08.970 --> 15:10.870
<b>You bastard!</b>

15:10.870 --> 15:12.770
<b>There's your wife.</b>

15:12.770 --> 15:15.540
<b>She wouldn't do as I said
to the very end.</b>

15:15.540 --> 15:17.770
<b>It's all this woman's fault.</b>

15:18.380 --> 15:20.010
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

15:20.620 --> 15:23.380
<b>You wouldn't actually kill me,
would you?</b>

15:23.380 --> 15:26.050
<b>Gods don't kill, after all, right?</b>

15:26.050 --> 15:27.820
<b>Bastard!</b>

15:27.820 --> 15:29.290
<b>An illusion?!</b>

15:30.260 --> 15:33.790
<b>It's no use, Lord Zenon.
I'm no longer here.</b>

15:33.790 --> 15:36.260
<b>I wish you good health. Farewell.</b>

15:37.730 --> 15:42.000
<b>So, this was where you'd
gone to hide, Souei?!</b>

15:42.000 --> 15:46.170
<b>But you certainly kill a lot more
than you used to.</b>

15:46.170 --> 15:50.580
<b>Doing these things used to be my job.</b>

15:50.580 --> 15:53.450
<b>Or have you quit being a god?</b>

15:53.450 --> 15:56.850
<b>You committed the forbidden act
of taking a human as your wife</b>

15:56.850 --> 16:00.860
<b>and now, you'll even break
the prohibition to kill?</b>

16:00.860 --> 16:05.130
<b>Souei, too bad, but I haven't
quit being a god.</b>

16:05.130 --> 16:08.760
<b>We're going to be the gods of
a new world in the Heavens!</b>

16:10.060 --> 16:13.670
<b>Is that not essentially rebellion
against the Heavens?</b>

16:13.670 --> 16:15.140
<b>That's what it boils down to.</b>

16:16.270 --> 16:17.830
<b>A new world in the Heavens...</b>

16:18.810 --> 16:24.480
<b>Homura! I see! That's why you're
after the Seiten Scripture!</b>

16:24.480 --> 16:27.040
<b>As perceptive as always, though
that's all you have going for you.</b>

16:28.850 --> 16:30.920
<b>I already know.</b>

16:30.920 --> 16:32.850
<b>Your real body is your shadow, right?!</b>

16:33.820 --> 16:35.290
<b>I'm not letting you get away this time!</b>

16:36.290 --> 16:39.860
<b>Please wait! Please let me...
Please let me serve you again!</b>

16:39.860 --> 16:42.120
<b>Shut up! Go say your regrets
in the world beyond!</b>

16:45.400 --> 16:46.870
<b>And my regret...</b>

16:47.600 --> 16:50.730
<b>...is that I ever made you
my subordinate.</b>

16:52.510 --> 16:54.040
<b>It's over then.</b>

16:54.040 --> 16:55.670
<b>No, it's just starting.</b>

16:56.440 --> 16:59.780
<b>Lord Shien, most of their forces have
been brought under control.</b>

16:59.780 --> 17:03.050
<b>I see. Then all that remains is THAT.</b>

17:03.050 --> 17:04.640
<b>Yeah, just THAT.</b>

17:08.890 --> 17:11.060
<b>We should be safe now that
we've come this far.</b>

17:11.060 --> 17:12.530
<b>All you need do is get on
a flying dragon and...</b>

17:19.570 --> 17:21.370
<b>So?</b>

17:21.370 --> 17:23.340
<b>You still have business with me?</b>

17:23.340 --> 17:26.070
<b>I thought I'd remind you.</b>

17:26.070 --> 17:28.240
<b>Of what?</b>

17:28.240 --> 17:34.050
<b>The one teaching your master,
Koumyou Sanzo, passed down to you.</b>

17:34.050 --> 17:35.680
<b>To hold nothing.</b>

17:35.680 --> 17:38.520
<b>If you meet the Buddha,
kill the Buddha.</b>

17:38.520 --> 17:41.090
<b>If you meet your father,
kill your father.</b>

17:41.090 --> 17:43.260
<b>Free of everything, not bound
by anything,</b>

17:43.260 --> 17:46.830
<b>only live your life just as it is.</b>

17:46.830 --> 17:48.320
<b>There's no way I'd forget that.</b>

17:49.000 --> 17:50.700
<b>Really?</b>

17:50.700 --> 17:52.130
<b>Then, that's fine.</b>

17:53.570 --> 17:55.840
<b>The path you guys are traveling along</b>

17:55.840 --> 17:58.640
<b>is certain to become even
more harsh and painful.</b>

17:58.640 --> 18:03.080
<b>When that time comes, that teaching
is what will bolster your hearts.</b>

18:03.080 --> 18:04.940
<b>Don't you forget that.</b>

18:06.580 --> 18:08.450
<b>And don't you lose now.</b>

18:08.450 --> 18:12.150
<b>I can't have you wrecking
my enjoyment.</b>

18:17.190 --> 18:19.460
<b>Lady Gyokumen Koushu,
please get away!</b>

18:19.460 --> 18:20.960
<b>We'll take care of this.</b>

18:20.960 --> 18:22.430
<b>Stop that already.</b>

18:24.700 --> 18:27.570
<b>That person's a god.</b>

18:27.570 --> 18:29.900
<b>We don't stand a chance against him.</b>

18:30.770 --> 18:32.740
<b>Ni Jenyi...</b>

18:32.740 --> 18:36.140
<b>Lady Gyokumen Koushu,
it'd be advisable for you</b>

18:36.140 --> 18:39.370
<b>to stop struggling uselessly and
hand over the Seiten Scripture.</b>

18:40.010 --> 18:42.650
<b>If you do that, he should at least
leave us with our lives.</b>

18:42.650 --> 18:44.280
<b>After all, he's a god.</b>

18:45.290 --> 18:49.520
<b>Very well. All I care about is
obtaining the Seiten Scripture.</b>

18:50.120 --> 18:52.360
<b>Do you expect me to believe that?!</b>

18:52.360 --> 18:57.030
<b>Whether we believe it or not, they
hold our lives in their hands.</b>

18:57.030 --> 19:00.930
<b>Besides, they say those who
believe shall be saved.</b>

19:02.140 --> 19:06.040
<b>They also say tomorrow brings
its own fortunes.</b>

19:07.210 --> 19:09.900
<b>Is there some reason you
want to be saved?</b>

19:11.350 --> 19:12.880
<b>You must be joking.</b>

19:12.880 --> 19:18.420
<b>Then what kind of tomorrow do you
have that's worth believing in?</b>

19:18.420 --> 19:21.220
<b>There probably isn't anything.</b>

19:25.990 --> 19:30.130
<b>Ni, how do you intend to take
responsibility for this?!</b>

19:30.130 --> 19:36.070
<b>Oh, please, it was all I could do to
save you, Lady Gyokumen Koushu.</b>

19:36.070 --> 19:38.770
<b>I do believe I worked enough to
deserve what I'm being paid.</b>

19:46.350 --> 19:48.180
<b>Oh, what a beautiful morning!</b>

19:48.180 --> 19:49.620
<b>How so?</b>

19:49.620 --> 19:54.290
<b>So, you slept here? I wondered why
you weren't in your blankets.</b>

19:54.290 --> 19:56.790
<b>I guess you're pretty
restless in your sleep.</b>

19:56.790 --> 19:58.560
<b>Shut up! Die!</b>

19:58.560 --> 20:03.000
<b>Good grief, Master Sanzo must have
low blood pressure.</b>

20:03.000 --> 20:06.370
<b>Quit grumbling. If you're all
packed up, let's get going!</b>

20:06.370 --> 20:09.000
<b>Why? We haven't had breakfast yet.</b>

20:09.000 --> 20:11.670
<b>Shut up! We don't have time for that!</b>

20:11.670 --> 20:12.770
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

20:12.770 --> 20:17.110
<b>Is something wrong, Sanzo?
You're in a really bad mood!</b>

20:17.110 --> 20:18.940
<b>I had a really rude awakening.</b>

20:25.590 --> 20:27.250
<b>Are you sure, Zenon?</b>

20:27.250 --> 20:31.090
<b>You've already accomplished what
you came to the Lower World for.</b>

20:31.090 --> 20:35.000
<b>Well, yeah, but it's only just begun.</b>

20:35.000 --> 20:37.430
<b>Let me keep you company to the end.</b>

20:39.770 --> 20:43.360
<b>Then next is Konzen's Maten Scripture.</b>

20:51.280 --> 21:00.120
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

21:01.460 --> 21:11.890
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:13.230 --> 21:23.370
<b>Emotions like the sand spilling
out of my hands</b>

21:24.680 --> 21:37.690
<b>The words that pierced my heart
back then suddenly ache</b>

21:37.690 --> 21:49.100
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:49.100 --> 22:00.410
<b>The more I lose, the more certain
this feeling becomes</b>

22:00.410 --> 22:12.590
<b>Now, I can surely walk
on and on forever</b>
